// ISO27001 Statement of Applicability — for each Annex A control the
// organization decides to scope in/out, a real admin records the control
// id/title THEY enter (this app never fabricates official ISO 27001:2022
// Annex A control text), applicability decision, justification, and
// implementation status.
model StatementOfApplicabilityEntry {
  id                   String                  @id @default(cuid())
  controlId            String                  @unique
  controlTitle         String
